1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,480
A new year, a new first temple visit, with my family.

2
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:16,560
I'm supposed to meet up with Yamada to do the same thing in half an hour.

3
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:22,960
The plan is to make up some excuse, stay behind as my family leaves, and meet up with her.

4
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:25,140
It's the perfect schedule.

5
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:28,880
Oh, hey! Look, Kyo, isn't that your friend?

6
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:30,920
Hmm? That's Yamada, isn't it?

7
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:36,620
Why are you always early?

8
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,680
Huh? No way! Where is she? Right there!

9
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:43,740
Wow! It's her in the flesh! The real Yamada.

10
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:45,660
She's huge, huh?

11
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,120
She leaves that impression.

12
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:49,100
Not quite what I expected.

13
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:50,680
Quit staring at her!

14
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:53,880
You know, I forgot to ask you something very important.

15
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:56,060
Does this Yamada girl have a boyfriend?

16
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:58,300
Why do you ask?

17
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:01,040
I mean, she's all dressed up.

18
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:05,140
She keeps checking her mirror, working on her smile.

19
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:08,920
She's clearly waiting there for someone that she really likes.

20
00:01:09,540 --> 00:01:10,940
Yeah, right. Whatever.

21
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:14,080
Oh, right. Silly me. My bad.

22
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:17,380
Must be imagining things. Go say hi or something.

23
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:18,960
I'll pass.

24
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:22,760
She just wants to stand by and watch me get humiliated.

25
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:25,760
Oh, man. I said I don't want to.

